  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, honey, smoked paprika, garlic, and 1 tablespoon of oil.",
    "Add the beef to the marinade and mix to coat. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
